  "The deduction set has a camera clock that runs fast, a door that opens unlogged from inside and a master key anyone could take. Three different questions turn on these.",
  "Strengthen and weaken options include ones that hit a side claim, ones that help when the stem asks you to hurt, a strengthener whose first half reads like the rule succeeding, and a weakener that attacks the measure the evidence used rather than the evidence.",
  "No length tell: options in a question are within a few words of each other, the key is the longest (or tied for longest) in only {LONGEST} of {NQ} questions and the shortest in {SHORTEST}, and the letters are spread 7-7-6-6."
